  "congress": 118,
  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 20 (Tuesday, January 31, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. McCOLLUM:\nH.R. 668.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nPursuant to Article I Section 8 of the Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nThis bill permanently withdraws over 234,000 acres of\nfederal land and waters within the Rainy River Watershed\nadjacent to the Boundary Waters Canoe Area Wilderness from\nmineral leasing.\n[Page H578]\n</pre>",
